FFmpegKitNext / FFmpeg

The Director X native dependency bundle includes a source-pinned LGPL-3.0-or-later build of FFmpegKitNext 8.1.0 with FFmpeg 8.1.2, OpenH264, libass, and the supporting libraries recorded in third_party/ffmpeg-kit-next/native-lock.json. The exact upstream commit is 3e223118e6e8fb6208693ecf3952e77cd096f587 and the reproducible build command is ./nix-android.sh -p android-r27d --enable-libass --enable-libjxl --enable-android-media-codec --enable-android-zlib --enable-openh264 --jobs=8. The inherited native security configuration disables the VobSub, TDSC, MACE6, ADX/AAX, PNG/APNG, RASC, IAMF, and LCL/ZLIB components named in the lockfile's required advisory inventory.

